    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What happens to an old house when its owner dies or vanishes under mysterious circumstances? Usually, the house is left abandoned. And when something is abandoned, it draws in all kinds of people looking to claim things that seemingly have no owner. But do these things truly belong to no one</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you become one of those people looking to profit from someone else\u2019s misfortune by selling a few intriguing items that are said to be hidden inside the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BARABIZNA</strong> is a short, spine-chilling horror game set in a creepy old house<strong>.\u00a0</strong>Your mission: find and collect all the hidden items before it's too late. But beware... you're not alone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run offers a <strong>different set</strong> <strong>of items</strong> to collect. Find them all and escape with your car to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate goal is to <strong>reach your car and escape</strong>, but you can't leave without the full set of items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457800/extras/a8ce19bcc31611590f4f8b1492a3bc6e.poster.avif?t=1753356308\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457800/extras/a8ce19bcc31611590f4f8b1492a3bc6e.webm?t=1753356308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457800/extras/a8ce19bcc31611590f4f8b1492a3bc6e.mp4?t=1753356308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have <strong>15 minutes of flashlight battery</strong>. If the light dies, you\u2019ll be plunged into darkness\u2014alone, vulnerable, and hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457800/extras/8a3943fd1163359f3ee65c0b2cf24932.poster.avif?t=1753356308\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457800/extras/8a3943fd1163359f3ee65c0b2cf24932.webm?t=1753356308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457800/extras/8a3943fd1163359f3ee65c0b2cf24932.mp4?t=1753356308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each item you collect makes the game <strong>more difficult</strong>, turning the search for the last few items into a true challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need to <strong>listen carefully</strong> and <strong>choose your routes wisely</strong> to avoid an threat that stalks the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457800/extras/a33e901647910c60a2dd9f0e056205f0.poster.avif?t=1753356308\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457800/extras/a33e901647910c60a2dd9f0e056205f0.webm?t=1753356308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457800/extras/a33e901647910c60a2dd9f0e056205f0.mp4?t=1753356308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring <strong>moody visuals</strong>, <strong>minimal UI</strong>, and an <strong>eerie soundscape</strong> designed to pull you into the horror.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Info:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre:</strong> First-person psychological horror, walking simulator with stealth elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated Playtime:</strong> 15\u201330 minutes per run </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</strong> Randomized objectives make each session unique</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Combat:</strong> Pure survival through stealth, exploration, and clever decision-making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Only</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What happens to an old house when its owner dies or vanishes under mysterious circumstances? Usually, the house is left abandoned. And when something is abandoned, it draws in all kinds of people looking to claim things that seemingly have no owner. But do these things truly belong to no one</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you become one of those people looking to profit from someone else\u2019s misfortune by selling a few intriguing items that are said to be hidden inside the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BARABIZNA</strong> is a short, spine-chilling horror game set in a creepy old house<strong>.\u00a0</strong>Your mission: find and collect all the hidden items before it's too late. But beware... you're not alone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run offers a <strong>different set</strong> <strong>of items</strong> to collect. Find them all and escape with your car to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate goal is to <strong>reach your car and escape</strong>, but you can't leave without the full set of items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457800/extras/a8ce19bcc31611590f4f8b1492a3bc6e.poster.avif?t=1753356308\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457800/extras/a8ce19bcc31611590f4f8b1492a3bc6e.webm?t=1753356308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457800/extras/a8ce19bcc31611590f4f8b1492a3bc6e.mp4?t=1753356308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have <strong>15 minutes of flashlight battery</strong>. If the light dies, you\u2019ll be plunged into darkness\u2014alone, vulnera