imulator with stealth elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated Playtime:</strong> 15\u201330 minutes per run </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</strong> Randomized objectives make each session unique</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Combat:</strong> Pure survival through stealth, exploration, and clever decision-making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Only</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
